WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.748 --> 00:00:07.483
Every key term and thinker in the course lives here, with real definitions and real citations.

2
00:00:07.483 --> 00:00:17.380
Search or browse by week. Terms are written in two to four sentences, enough to actually understand, and each carries the citation it comes from.

3
00:00:17.380 --> 00:00:25.970
Use terms to speak precisely. Discussion posts and written work read stronger when the course vocabulary is used accurately.

4
00:00:25.970 --> 00:00:33.214
Follow a term back to its week. Each entry names its home week, so you can revisit the fuller context.

5
00:00:33.214 --> 00:00:35.818
Nothing here is graded.

6
00:00:35.818 --> 00:00:40.378
Where next: Turn terms into memory with Concept Flashcards.
